WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.760
The United States and North Korea

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.740
two countries that can’t seem to find a
path to peace

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:12.000
but solving the conflict might come down to the meaning of a word

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.980
President Trump: denuclearization is a
very important, it’s a very important word,

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.260
become a very well-used word and a lot of
people don’t know what it means

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.800
but to me it’s pretty obvious, we have to get rid of the nukes.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.340
For many U.S. administrations

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.020
“denuclearization” has meant

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.500
North Korea will:
* destroy all of its nuclear weapons

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.100
* destroy its ballistic missiles

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.300
* and abandon its nuclear program

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.220
but North Korean leaders don’t see it that
way

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:45.180
For them, denuclearization is a process that
would result in

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:49.280
total disarmament of the Korean Peninsula

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.740
That means the United States would have to:

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.340
* withdraw all of its troops from South Korea

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.260
* and end its treaty alliance with South Korea

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.740
before North Korea would give up its nuclear program

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.100
Some experts even think North Korea wants
the U.S. to:

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.560
* withdraw all of its troops from Japan

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.280
* end its treaty alliance with Japan

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.460
* and destroy the entire U.S. nuclear arsenal

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.760
conditions Washington is unlikely to accept

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:15.700
With this vast difference in the meaning of
denuclearization

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:19.340
it’s easy to understand why there has been
no resolution

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:24.600
and unless the two sides can agree on what
denuclearization means

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:31.220
it will be hard to overcome hostility on the
Korean Peninsula

